00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:03.010
I have a mission that only you can do.

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:07.370
What do you have to say?

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:09.820
Man, you always fall for it.

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:15.830
Class F declaring war on us is just hilarious.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:17.490
We'll show them who's boss.

00:12:18.030 --> 00:12:19.700
Are you sure about that, Kyouji?

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:22.580
Class F has defeated both class E and D.

00:12:24.330 --> 00:12:26.500
Are you scared of them, Yuuka?

00:12:26.740 --> 00:12:27.840
You're kidding.

00:12:27.840 --> 00:12:32.240
No matter how hard they try, they won't be able to beat us, class C.

00:12:32.240 --> 00:12:35.540
Then there's no way we can lose to them either.

00:12:35.970 --> 00:12:37.040
I guess you could say that...

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:40.610
There must be some trick that lets them keep winning like this.

00:12:41.100 --> 00:12:44.560
So we're not going to risk going up against them directly.

00:12:45.350 --> 00:12:46.350
Kyouji...

00:12:46.350 --> 00:12:48.930
See? I'm not dumb.

00:12:49.220 --> 00:12:52.150
I'll pay them back for what happened last time.

00:12:53.390 --> 00:12:53.630
Temporary

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:55.040
That concludes our plan.

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:57.150
I want your cooperation, everyone.

00:12:57.150 --> 00:12:58.410
We can win this!

00:13:00.310 --> 00:13:00.440
Time   Seventeen Twenty-eight

00:13:00.440 --> 00:13:01.830
All right, you're all dismissed.

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:04.270
Thanks for today!

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:09.030
You're sure about not trading facilities with class D?

00:13:09.030 --> 00:13:11.500
Yeah, I'm planting seeds for future battles.

00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:12.170
Planting seeds?

00:13:12.690 --> 00:13:14.880
Just wait for them to sprout.

00:13:14.910 --> 00:13:16.250
Time   Seventeen Thirty-one

00:13:18.760 --> 00:13:19.750
What the hell happened?

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:21.350
This is unbelievable...

00:13:21.350 --> 00:13:22.550
Who did this?

00:13:22.550 --> 00:13:25.050
I'm afraid that class B did it.

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:29.240
They wanted to break our utensils to
prevent us from replenishing our points.

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:31.680
Man, did they seriously think this'd work?

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:32.600
Lame.

00:13:34.850 --> 00:13:35.990
What's the matter, Himeji?

00:13:35.990 --> 00:13:38.230
No, nothing...

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:43.620
You're going to fucking pay for this, Nemoto!

00:13:43.700 --> 00:13:46.130
You bet your ass he will!

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:48.160
Guys, calm the hell down!

00:13:48.400 --> 00:13:48.920
But...

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:52.160
Winning the ESB is the best
revenge we can get on them.

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:54.360
But we won't be able to win if we lose our calm.

00:13:54.360 --> 00:13:56.000
He's got this all planned out.

00:13:57.490 --> 00:13:58.320
Time     Fourteen Fifty-one

00:13:58.320 --> 00:13:59.080
The showdown of hatred between class F and class B finally begins.

00:13:59.080 --> 00:14:00.430
Next Day

00:14:00.430 --> 00:14:00.440
The showdown of hatred between class F and class B finally begins.

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:03.080
Begin

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:05.540
It's time for war! Let's go!

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:10.350
Charge!

00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:12.370
They're here.

00:14:13.710 --> 00:14:14.820
What a bunch of idiots.

00:14:15.270 --> 00:14:16.600
Proceed according to our plan.

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:18.200
They can't win.

00:14:18.680 --> 00:14:19.950
Take 'em down!

00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:24.400
Dammit... They're way too strong!

00:14:27.890 --> 00:14:30.010
Are we really going to lose this?

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:32.350
Yeah, these guys are no slouches.

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:33.630
Yoshii!

00:14:33.630 --> 00:14:35.990
Himeji, it's not your turn yet.

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:36.000
Orders
Himeji, it's not your turn yet.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:38.700
Sakamoto said to use this when you're in trouble.
Orders

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:38.980
Sakamoto said to use this when you're in trouble.

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:39.630
Yuuji said so?

00:14:39.630 --> 00:14:40.610
This is...

00:14:40.610 --> 00:14:41.420
All right!

00:14:42.430 --> 00:14:43.680
Listen up!

00:14:44.050 --> 00:14:46.810
Class B's rep Nemoto has a girlfriend!

00:14:47.160 --> 00:14:48.720
What?

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:51.890
His girlfriend is the rep of class C, Yuuka Koyama!

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:53.810
What!?

00:14:54.050 --> 00:14:58.740
Not only that... He made his girl-
friend cook lunch for him!

00:14:58.740 --> 00:15:01.770
WHAT!?

00:15:02.680 --> 00:15:05.580
As the rage on the battlefield has reached unfathomable heights...

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:10.990
the members of the FFF have forgotten all about the hell of supplementary lessons

00:15:11.560 --> 00:15:14.440
and have transformed into the messengers of genocide.

00:15:14.910 --> 00:15:17.720
We cannot forgive you...

00:15:19.930 --> 00:15:23.070
How dare that bastard...

00:15:23.070 --> 00:15:26.600
Do you understand the pain of being alone!?

00:15:26.600 --> 00:15:27.710
What are these guys!?

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:30.050
I give up! Let's retreat!

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:35.050
The tables have turned!

00:15:35.050 --> 00:15:36.010
Charge!

00:15:40.770 --> 00:15:42.130
Are they crazy!?

00:15:42.130 --> 00:15:44.010
Aren't they scared of supplementary lessons!?

00:15:44.010 --> 00:15:45.180
What's the matter?

00:15:45.180 --> 00:15:47.710
Class F is a bunch of lunatics!

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:49.760
They're suicide bombing our forces!

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:52.620
I guess I need a little more insurance.

00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:54.950
Time     Fifteen Twenty-one

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:57.720
Those who were KIA must receive supplementary lessons...

00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:03.320
Sugawa, I won't let you die in vain.

00:16:03.320 --> 00:16:07.590
You helped me vent!

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:11.400
He's still mad about what
happened with Ms. Funakoshi...

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:13.310
We've lost quite a few people.

00:16:13.310 --> 00:16:14.800
We need to redo our formation.

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:18.700
Go replenish your points if you're running low!

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:23.630
Himeji-

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:27.200
Isn't that Nemoto?

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:30.650
Why did you sabotage our classroom?

00:16:31.030 --> 00:16:33.010
Do you have proof that we did it?

00:16:33.620 --> 00:16:34.370
Well...

00:16:35.700 --> 00:16:37.210
Yes, we did it.

00:16:37.210 --> 00:16:38.010
I have proof as well.

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:40.410
I'll teach you a lesson! Summoning-

00:16:41.720 --> 00:16:44.480
Whoops, that was close.

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:49.690
Isn't it thoughtful of the perp to present the evidence himself?

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:51.130
No...

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:53.850
I found some pretty interesting stuff.

00:16:53.850 --> 00:16:57.350
Writing love letters in this day and age is pretty cute, I'd say.

00:16:57.880 --> 00:16:59.370
Give it back!

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:01.780
I wonder what's written in it...

00:17:04.320 --> 00:17:05.600
Whoops...

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:07.520
I guess I'll enjoy the contents later.

00:17:08.030 --> 00:17:09.610
You jerk...

00:17:09.610 --> 00:17:12.450
Well, just so you know, we would've won even if I didn't do this.

00:17:12.450 --> 00:17:14.100
It's just in case.

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:16.470
I'll give it back to you once the ESB is over.

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:19.130
Assuming I don't change my mind, that is.

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:25.100
What's the matter, Akihisa?

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:26.260
Running away?

00:17:26.260 --> 00:17:27.490
If you are, I'll tie you up.

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:29.700
Yuuji, I need to talk.

00:17:29.700 --> 00:17:30.230
What's up?

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:32.630
Please let Himeji rest for this battle.

00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:34.350
Did something happen?

00:17:34.850 --> 00:17:35.810
I can't say.

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:39.490
Fine, if you say so.

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:44.320
However, you'll take over Himeji's job instead.

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:45.660
All right.

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:47.990
Launch a surprise attack on their main camp.

00:17:47.990 --> 00:17:49.320
I'll let you handle the specifics.

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:50.650
Can you do it?

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:52.150
I'll try.

00:17:52.150 --> 00:17:54.450
No, I <i>will</i> do it.

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:56.650
I like that spirit, Akihisa.

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:57.190
Time   Sixteen Twenty-eight

00:17:57.190 --> 00:17:58.190
Oh, and, Yuuji...

00:17:58.190 --> 00:17:58.640
Time   Sixteen Twenty-eight

00:17:58.640 --> 00:17:59.280
What's up?

00:17:59.280 --> 00:17:59.600
Time   Sixteen Twenty-eight

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:00.110
Time   Sixteen Twenty-nine

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:02.620
Akihisa, are you serious about this?

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:06.340
This is the only way I can take them down with my own strength.

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:08.740
But you don't have the permission to summon...

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:11.830
Don't worry, I have this.

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:13.160
Awaken!

00:18:13.720 --> 00:18:15.810
Go!

00:18:21.130 --> 00:18:22.300
This is nothing!

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:28.870
What's going on?

00:18:29.390 --> 00:18:30.790
I'm not done yet!

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:35.020
Are you okay, Akihisa!?

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:38.790
This is nothing!

00:18:39.750 --> 00:18:41.080
I will...

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:45.490
win this fight no matter what!

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:47.970
No matter what...!

00:18:49.260 --> 00:18:50.840
For Himeji!

00:19:03.930 --> 00:19:04.760
There he is!

00:19:08.510 --> 00:19:10.740
Did you think I'd leave myself open?

00:19:11.070 --> 00:19:13.150
Your surprise attack is a failure.

00:19:13.530 --> 00:19:14.450
He took the bait.

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:17.000
Voyeur!

00:19:19.180 --> 00:19:19.740
What?

00:19:20.690 --> 00:19:23.540
Health battle... Summon!

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:27.880
No way...

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:29.630
He brought a teacher with him!?

00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:32.710
Ironman Nishimura, the teacher in charge of the detentions,

00:19:32.710 --> 00:19:37.780
can permit summoning of any subject and possesses godlike athletic skills.

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:41.720
Jesus Christ...

00:19:42.770 --> 00:19:44.440
Battle's over!

00:19:44.440 --> 00:19:46.160
The winner is class F!

00:19:49.130 --> 00:19:51.040
Too bad, Nemoto.

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:52.290
Sakamoto...

00:19:53.320 --> 00:19:56.220
I have a proposal for you guys.

00:19:56.950 --> 00:20:02.510
Under normal circumstances, you would have to trade your facilities with our cardboard boxes.

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:05.600
However, if you agree to my
condition, that can be avoided.

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:07.060
Condition?

00:20:07.300 --> 00:20:12.540
Nemoto, if you wear this and listen to my orders, we won't need to trade.

00:20:12.860 --> 00:20:13.770
What?

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:15.080
What the hell are you talking about!?

00:20:15.080 --> 00:20:16.510
There's no fucking way I'll do that!

00:20:16.510 --> 00:20:18.410
You've got class B's unanimous consent!

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:20.060
Yeah, we'll make it happen! Just leave it up to us!

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:21.510
We'll force him if he says no!

00:20:21.510 --> 00:20:23.540
Hey, I'm not going to-

00:20:26.820 --> 00:20:28.810
Is this okay, Akihisa?

00:20:35.520 --> 00:20:38.420
Baka, go go home!

00:20:41.640 --> 00:20:44.590
Baka, go go home!

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:47.860
It's a time of peace now that school's out

00:20:47.860 --> 00:20:49.410
If I were to compare her

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:50.950
"She's a real angel!"

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:53.920
Then a sudden note ruined my fun

00:20:53.920 --> 00:20:55.310
It said I have a makeup test!

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:56.700
It's hell!

00:20:57.030 --> 00:21:00.040
I was joking with my friends,

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:03.070
"There's no way someone is that stupid!"

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:06.150
But deep down inside,

00:21:06.150 --> 00:21:07.440
I was screaming,

00:21:07.440 --> 00:21:10.400
"That was me! I'm that stupid!"

00:21:10.820 --> 00:21:16.980
I thought the "Monthly" sign in the parking lot

00:21:16.980 --> 00:21:22.260
was the company's name!

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:25.010
For the longest time...

00:21:25.710 --> 00:21:28.710
Stupidity is a manly character

00:21:28.710 --> 00:21:31.410
Is that our lack of common sense?

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:34.720
Rules are useless in this world

00:21:34.720 --> 00:21:37.720
Eat Korean BBQ every night and overthrow the masses!

00:21:37.720 --> 00:21:39.360
Look!

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:43.930
The sun that rose from the west is now setting down.

00:21:43.930 --> 00:21:46.970
Run! It's almost dinner time.

00:21:46.970 --> 00:21:53.840
Let's go home!

00:22:01.260 --> 00:22:03.920
Here, Himeji. This is yours.

00:22:03.920 --> 00:22:06.500
Thank you very much, Yoshii!

00:22:06.790 --> 00:22:08.660
Thank goodness...

00:22:08.660 --> 00:22:10.380
Umm, Himeji...

00:22:10.870 --> 00:22:12.000
About that letter...

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:14.930
Yeah, it's the same letter from last time.

00:22:16.430 --> 00:22:20.410
I couldn't bring myself to deliver it...

00:22:20.410 --> 00:22:22.670
And that caused a lot of trouble for everyone.

00:22:23.980 --> 00:22:24.930
Himeji...

00:22:25.480 --> 00:22:28.250
This letter has caused me a lot of pain,

00:22:28.900 --> 00:22:31.550
but it's also brought me a lot of happiness.

00:22:31.550 --> 00:22:33.850
So I'm fine with the way things are.

00:22:36.030 --> 00:22:39.360
I don't want to rely on this letter anymore.

00:22:43.010 --> 00:22:47.160
I will deliver my feelings personally.

00:22:49.060 --> 00:22:51.590
Although I don't think I can do that anytime soon...

00:22:52.090 --> 00:22:54.260
There's one thing I can say for sure right now.

00:22:54.870 --> 00:22:55.710
Yoshii...

00:22:56.070 --> 00:22:57.490
What's the matter?

00:22:57.490 --> 00:23:00.710
May I call you Akihisa?

00:23:01.390 --> 00:23:05.960
Wait! The FFF will go berserk if you do this...! And to Hideyoshi, this is...

00:23:05.960 --> 00:23:08.320
May I, Akihisa?

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:11.930
Sure.

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:18.270
Yuuji, what's driving your desire to wage war?

00:23:18.270 --> 00:23:19.930
Do you want better facilities?

00:23:19.930 --> 00:23:22.340
I don't give a damn about chairs and desks.

00:23:23.270 --> 00:23:26.990
I just want to prove to the world that grades aren't everything.

00:23:27.550 --> 00:23:28.250
That's all.

00:23:29.160 --> 00:23:31.550
So don't hold back, Shouko.

00:23:32.150 --> 00:23:33.030
Very well then.

00:23:33.500 --> 00:23:35.030
We'll fight you with all we've got.

00:23:36.910 --> 00:23:43.310
Question 12: What do you call a joyous resolution in a novel or play?

00:23:43.310 --> 00:23:44.080
Last boss fight!

00:23:44.080 --> 00:23:45.390
You don't have enough exp.

00:23:45.390 --> 00:23:48.860
Next episode: Love and Courage and Our Fight Has Just Begun (temp).

00:23:48.860 --> 00:23:50.850
This will be on your test.
